{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/lem-frobenius-cocasimir-refuted-deuteron","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Lemma","doco:Section"],"label":"lem:frobenius-cocasimir-refuted-deuteron","kind":"lemma","title":"Frobenius co-Casimir $\\Delta_\\lambda$ ansatz refuted at the deuteron","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/conj-rho-prefactor-structural"],"tags":["delta-lambda","refutation","co-casimir","gap-a","deuteron","formalize-the-refutation"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.BraidKnot.coCasimir_refuted_deuteron","text":"frobenius-cocasimir-refuted-deuteron.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"lem:frobenius-cocasimir-refuted-deuteron\"></a><p><em>The Frobenius co-Casimir prescription <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Delta_\\lambda = 1/\\dim_q(\\lambda)</code> fails to close the binding energy formula for the deuteron.</em></p>\n<p><em>The signed binding density yields <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">+0.145 m_e</code>, missing the target <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">-4.35 m_e</code>. The gap exceeds the tolerance. The sign is incorrect.</em></p>\n<p>This algebraic refutation eliminates the co-Casimir ansatz as a universal correction factor. No rescaling was applied to <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Delta_\\lambda</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/frobenius-cocasimir-refuted-deuteron.md","heading":"Lemma","number":"13.32.3","page":"b/lem-frobenius-cocasimir-refuted-deuteron","qa":{"counts":{"pass":90,"fail":2,"warn":0,"na":12,"unknown":0,"stale":74},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.DeltaLambdaRefutation.coCasimir_refuted_deuteron","via":"ref","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/DeltaLambdaRefutation.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
